var e=[{section:`general`,question:`What is Canadia Gateway?`,answer:`Canadia Gateway is Canadia Bank's payment gateway platform that enables merchants to securely accept digital payments through a unified set of APIs. It supports KHQR and Deeplink payments, allowing businesses to integrate secure payment acceptance into websites, mobile applications, and POS systems.`},{section:`general`,question:`What payment methods are supported?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Canadia Gateway currently supports the following payment methods:`,items:[`KHQR Payment`,`Deeplink Payment`],footerText:`Additional payment methods may be introduced in future releases.`},relatedLink:{text:`View Payment Methods`,href:`/category/payments`}},{section:`general`,question:`Which currencies are supported?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Canadia Gateway currently supports transactions in:`,items:[`Cambodian Riel (KHR)`,`US Dollar (USD)`]}},{section:`general`,question:`Which platforms can I integrate with?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Canadia Gateway APIs can be integrated into various business applications, including:`,items:[`Websites`,`Mobile Applications (iOS & Android)`,`Point-of-Sale (POS) Systems`,`Backend Services`,`Enterprise Applications`]}}],t=[{section:`integration`,question:`How do I integrate Canadia Gateway into my application?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Canadia Gateway provides REST APIs, SDKs, sample code, and comprehensive documentation to help developers integrate payment functionality into their applications.

Available SDKs include:`,items:[`iOS`,`Android`,`Java`,`Flutter`]}},{section:`integration`,question:`Which API should I integrate first?`,answer:{type:`ordered-list`,leadText:`For the best integration experience, we recommend the following sequence:`,items:[`Authentication`,`Create Payment`,`Handle Callback Notification`,`Payment Status Inquiry`,`Refund API (Optional)`]}},{section:`integration`,question:`Which payment method should I choose?`,answer:{type:`table`,leadText:`Choose the payment method that best fits your business requirements.`,tableData:{headers:[`Payment Method`,`Recommended Use Case`],rows:[{"Payment Method":`KHQR`,"Recommended Use Case":[`QR code payment acceptance`,`• Canadia KHQR API`,`• Canadia Ecommerce Checkout`]},{"Payment Method":`Deeplink`,"Recommended Use Case":`Mobile application checkout`}]}}},{section:`integration`,question:`Does Canadia Gateway provide SDKs and sample code?`,answer:`Yes. SDKs, sample code, and API documentation are available to accelerate your integration and reduce development effort.`},{section:`integration`,question:`Does Canadia Gateway support callback notifications?`,answer:`Yes. Callback notifications allow your system to receive real-time payment status updates automatically after a payment is completed.`},{section:`integration`,question:`Should I use Callback or Payment Status Inquiry?`,answer:`We recommend using Callback as the primary mechanism for receiving payment updates.

Payment Status Inquiry should only be used as a fallback if a callback is delayed or not received.`}],n=[{section:`sandbox`,question:`What is the Sandbox environment?`,answer:`The Sandbox environment allows developers to safely test API integration without processing real payments. All transactions are simulated and no actual funds are transferred.`},{section:`sandbox`,question:`How do I obtain Sandbox credentials?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Submit a Sandbox access request to the Canadia Bank team. Once approved, you will receive:`,items:[`Merchant ID`,`API Credentials`,`Sandbox Endpoint`,`Access Instructions`]}},{section:`sandbox`,question:`Can I simulate different payment scenarios?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Yes. The Sandbox environment supports testing of various payment outcomes, including:`,items:[`Successful Payment`,`Failed Payment`,`Cancelled Payment`,`Expired Payment`]}},{section:`sandbox`,question:`Can I check the latest payment status?`,answer:`Yes. You can retrieve the latest transaction status using the Payment Status Inquiry API at any time.`,relatedLink:{text:`Check Transaction Status API`,href:`/category/transactions/check-transaction-status`}},{section:`sandbox`,question:`Can I refund a transaction?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Yes. Canadia Gateway supports both:`,items:[`Full Refund`,`Partial Refund`]},relatedLink:{text:`Refund Guide`,href:`/category/refunds`}},{section:`sandbox`,question:`Can I perform multiple partial refunds?`,answer:`Yes. Multiple partial refunds are supported, provided that the total refunded amount does not exceed the original payment amount.`}],r=[{section:`security`,question:`Is payment information secure?`,answer:`Yes. Canadia Gateway uses industry-standard encryption and secure communication protocols to protect payment information and ensure every transaction is processed securely.`},{section:`security`,question:`How are APIs secured?`,answer:`API requests are protected using secure authentication mechanisms and HTTPS encryption. Developers should authenticate each request using a valid Access Token.`},{section:`security`,question:`Should API credentials be stored in my mobile or web application?`,answer:`No. API credentials and secret keys should always be stored securely on your backend server and must never be exposed in client-side applications.`}],i=[{section:`production`,question:`How do I move from Sandbox to Production?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Before requesting Production access, ensure that you have:`,items:[`Completed API integration`,`Successfully tested your integration in the Sandbox environment`,`Contacted the Canadia Bank team to obtain Production credentials`,`Completed the Production readiness and Go-Live process`]}},{section:`production`,question:`Do I need to change my integration for Production?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`Generally, no application logic changes are required. You only need to:`,items:[`Update the Production API Endpoint`,`Replace Sandbox credentials with Production credentials`]}},{section:`production`,question:`Why is my payment still in "Pending" status?`,answer:{type:`list`,leadText:`A payment may remain in Pending if:`,items:[`The customer has not completed the payment.`,`The payment is still being processed.`,`Final confirmation has not yet been received.`],footerText:`You may use the Payment Status Inquiry API to retrieve the latest status.`}}],a=[{section:`support`,question:`Where can I get technical support?`,answer:`For technical assistance, please contact the Canadia Gateway support team or your assigned Canadia Bank representative.`},{section:`support`,question:`Where can I find the API documentation?`,answer:`Comprehensive API documentation, integration guides, SDKs, and sample code are available in the Canadia Gateway Developer Portal.`,relatedLink:{text:`Developer Documentation`,href:`/`}}],o=[...e,...t,...n,...r,...i,...a];export{o as t};